#!RuleTest
#test CDISC-AD0369 expect=noViolation domain=ADLBC
# Rule:Description: *DTF is populated and neither *DT nor *DTM is populated
#note "ADTF populated and ADT populated -> noViolation"
# Declared-tier scope: the class= declaration disagrees with the columns, so #define must
# carry it to RuleRunner (ScenarioDeclaredScopeProvider.install).
#define standard=adamig version=1-3
dataset ADLBC class=BDS
col STUDYID type=Char
col USUBJID type=Char
col ADTF type=Char
col ADT type=Num
col ADTM type=Num
---
CDISCPILOT01 | 01-701-1015 | VAL | 5 | 
